{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34439","headline":"和袭美寄毗陵魏处士朴 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寄毗陵魏处士朴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经苑初成墨沼开，何人林下肯寻来。\n若非宗测图山後，即是韩康卖药回。\n溪籁自吟朱鹭曲，沙云还作白鸥媒。\n唯应地主公田熟，时送君家麴糵材。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}